			<Property name="English" value="As I boot up the operations terminal a hologram of a spacecraft going through a catastrophic planetary descent is beamed into my visor. It's clear that it's on an express elevator to hell. The impact with the planet's surface is made to look tiny. In truth, the impact crater could be vast.&#xA;&#xA;The ship's distress beacon can still be heard. It's encrypted, but if I crack the sequence I can lock the frequency..." />
