			<Property name="English" value="I'm taking in the view from cameras that feed in the view from the top of the Transmission Tower when I notice an urgent bleeping.&#xA;&#xA;An unanswered transmission seems to be logged with the operations terminal. The voice of a ship's pilot calmly intones news of its imminent death to its superiors, or perhaps its family. Its words, however, are lost in static. Only a wavelength cipher remains, if I can crack the code I can perhaps ascertain its true fate..." />
