			<Property name="USEnglish" value="" />
		</Property>
		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="EXP_NPC_ANOMALY_DESC_6">
			<Property name="Id" value="EXP_NPC_ANOMALY_DESC_6" />
			<Property name="English" value="Nada's paranoia is infectious. I find myself spying into the room before I enter. The Gek, Polo, seems occupied, taking joy in their chores, but Nada's shell is static save for the dancing lights. Was... was that a flash of red behind the visor? If it was, it doesn't repeat.&#xA;&#xA;I wait a moment and enter loudly. Polo greets me effusively, but Nada and I are standoffish, our trust failing." />
