		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="EXP_NPC_ANOMALY_DESC_8">
			<Property name="Id" value="EXP_NPC_ANOMALY_DESC_8" />
			<Property name="English" value="Nada stands close this time. If the being was capable of emotion, I'd say they were racked by it. They hesitantly rest a hand on my shoulder, and the visor moves close. I cannot see beneath the mask, but I feel that Nada is staring into my eyes.&#xA;&#xA;If I continue to the centre, this will be goodbye. Neither of us know if either will survive. If anything will survive. If freedom or destruction awaits us. Fearfully, sadly, Nada bades me farewell." />
