		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="TRA_NPC_ANOMALY_DESC_1">
			<Property name="Id" value="TRA_NPC_ANOMALY_DESC_1" />
			<Property name="English" value="The shorter entity, a Gek, has a jocular air about them. They idly wipe grease-splattered hands on their suit as they address me. Some sort of engineer, maybe. &#xA;&#xA;To my surprise, they speak my language. Other lifeforms have treated me with amused indifference, but Polo treats me like an equal.&#xA;&#xA;They are curious about my travels, about what sentient species I have seen, if I have met lifeforms they have not. They hope that I will share my experiences." />
