		</Property>
		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="TRA_NPC_ANOMALY_DESC_5">
			<Property name="Id" value="TRA_NPC_ANOMALY_DESC_5" />
			<Property name="English" value="Still feeling guilty about my earlier faux-pas, I attempt to greet Polo with a hug. Alarm floods the Gek's face, and they scuttle into a corner. &#xA;&#xA;An awkward moment passes, then Polo makes a conciliatory suggestion. Sentinels are the bane of both our lives. As I travel, I could make a point of destroying any I encounter. We might then have a better understanding of the irksome machines' weaknesses.&#xA;&#xA;And perhaps then we can be friends again, too." />
			<Property name="French" value="" />
			<Property name="Italian" value="" />
			<Property name="German" value="" />
			<Property name="Spanish" value="" />
			<Property name="Russian" value="" />
			<Property name="Polish" value="" />
