		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="TRA_NPC_ANOMALY_DESC_8">
			<Property name="Id" value="TRA_NPC_ANOMALY_DESC_8" />
			<Property name="English" value="Polo is oddly muted this time. At first I worry that I have caused offence again, but the Gek gestures forlornly at a jumble of broken electronics beside them. It seems that an accident has befallen some of Polo's precious research. &#xA;&#xA;Polo ushers me out the door apologetically. I know how dear the Gek's data was to them, and yearn to help. Perhaps when I next return, I can restock their archives with reports on a multitude of strange creatures." />
