		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="ALL_ABAN_DESC_1">
			<Property name="Id" value="ALL_ABAN_DESC_1" />
			<Property name="English" value="It looked like a wound on the world. Crimson and ragged-edged, like something that once lived but was then torn asunder. I should have stayed away.&#xA;&#xA;Had I the senses to taste the air of this planet, I imagine it would have reeked with some kind of alien fetor, but nothing could stall my curiosity.&#xA;&#xA;Was it dead? Where I touched it, the surface was moist and yielding. It seemed to become motile then, crawling on a mat of slow cilia, moving from me.&#xA;&#xA;I should have left it alone." />
			<Property name="French" value="" />
			<Property name="Italian" value="" />
			<Property name="German" value="" />
