		</Property>
		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="ALL_ABAN_DESC_12">
			<Property name="Id" value="ALL_ABAN_DESC_12" />
			<Property name="English" value="The experiment's final phase emerged from frustration. We wanted to learn something new. We wanted to know how they worked. We wanted to see inside them.&#xA;&#xA;An untested dimensional-warping process was used, one we believed would allow us to capture a drone intact. We would cage it, keep it docile. It was our error to believe we could.&#xA;&#xA;The machines co-opted the warp-tech and turned it upon us. In the horror of it all, our flesh was merged with their metal. Our questions were finally answered." />
			<Property name="French" value="" />
			<Property name="Italian" value="" />
			<Property name="German" value="" />
			<Property name="Spanish" value="" />
			<Property name="Russian" value="" />
