		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="ALL_ABAN_DESC_15">
			<Property name="Id" value="ALL_ABAN_DESC_15" />
			<Property name="English" value="The orb rests within its cage-cloak of crystal in so many guises. The angles of the shroud are utterly perfect.&#xA;&#xA;When measured, no device of known science can determine any flaws, any variation in surface even down to the molecular level.&#xA;&#xA;I have tried time and again to get close enough to touch it, but it retreats from me. I am not worthy to know its secrets yet.&#xA;&#xA;My mind must be opened wider. The layers of me revealed and peeled back in sections. There is no other path open. I have already begun to cut upon the skin." />
