			<Property name="Id" value="ALL_ATLAS_TEST_3" />
			<Property name="English" value="The universe followed the patterns of our thought. Power flowed through us. The constructs set within our minds directed the creation of all that you see and experience.&#xA;&#xA;You live and you die within this framework. To us, deep within the Beyond, it is no longer real." />
