		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="ALL_ATLAS_NEWLORE_1">
			<Property name="Id" value="ALL_ATLAS_NEWLORE_1" />
			<Property name="English" value="It is alien, unlike anything I have ever seen before. I should be afraid, but an inexorable pull draws me toward the heart of the construct. A need to know.&#xA;This is a remnant of the Atlas. It welcomes me, it knows what I am. It offers the promise of true understanding. &#xA;The intent burns in me. I will peer into the structure of causality and know this existence. If it is real, or some incalculably vast simulacrum authored by other intelligences." />
