		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="ALL_ATLAS_NEWLORE_2">
			<Property name="Id" value="ALL_ATLAS_NEWLORE_2" />
			<Property name="English" value="Another Atlas Interface; how many of these constructs exist in the deep void? How long have they been slumbering, waiting for a traveller?&#xA;Have they been waiting for me? Am I somehow...chosen?&#xA;I sense the creators of this reality; they emulate everything - the Gek and the Vy'Keen, the Korvax and the Sentinels. Every world that turns and form that lives.The ghost of them lingers and drives me on. There is so much I can learn from them." />
