		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="ALL_ATLAS_NEWLORE_3">
			<Property name="Id" value="ALL_ATLAS_NEWLORE_3" />
			<Property name="English" value="There is purpose in this, I am certain. The wanderer's way beckons, heedless of direction, freed from all control. But balanced against it is the promise of raw knowledge. The Atlas needs me so it may know itself.&#xA;I am at the crossroads of a momentous decision, I feel it with every parsec I travel. The open stars call to me, stirring something primal and undeniable. The path toward the endpoint unfolds. I must decide where my fate lies." />
