		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="ALL_ATLAS_NEWLORE_4">
			<Property name="Id" value="ALL_ATLAS_NEWLORE_4" />
			<Property name="English" value="Is it wrong to question this? I have crossed the orbits of countless stars and darkness unmeasured. And yet the Atlas remains changeless, my mission pre-destined. At each Interface, an Atlas Stone awaits me. I am driven to gather them, but to what end?&#xA;Perhaps there is only one great prism, materializing ahead of me each time I pass. Perhaps my course winds upon itself in a mad spiral. Have I come too far to turn back?" />
