		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="ALL_ATLAS_NEWLORE_6">
			<Property name="Id" value="ALL_ATLAS_NEWLORE_6" />
			<Property name="English" value="I dismiss recall of the days before this. The act of discovery for discovery's sake now seems like a foolish conceit. I have rejected the random and untethered path of the itinerant, and I am better for it. &#xA;With each encounter the Atlas speaks to me in clearer terms. I am no longer the nomad but the seeker, the carrier of illumination. It warns me not to stray, to bring it the knowledge it seeks - and my voyage is far from over." />
