			<Property name="Id" value="ALL_ATLAS_NEWLORE_7" />
			<Property name="English" value="What is learned can never be unlearned. I realize the trials in my path are all engineered to challenge me, test me, prove me worthy.&#xA;But I am afraid I have seen too much. The code that underpins the universe comes to me in glimpses, half-remembered visions. &#xA;Existence as a synthetic, governed by monolithic, complex algorithms. A program, as infinite as a universe. I am drawing back the veil on reality and what I see there is terrifying." />
